      "text": "churches built up to get gain will be consumed, 1 Ne. 22:23 (4 Ne. 1:26). priestcrafts are that men preach to get gain, 2 Ne. 26:29. learned shall say, Bring book and I will read, to get gain, 2 Ne. 27:15–16. judges stir people up to wickedness to get gain, Alma 11:3, 20. missionaries receive no gain, Alma 30:35 (Mosiah 2:14; Alma 1:26). Nephites and Lamanites have free intercourse to get gain, Hel. 6:8. Gadianton robbers fill judgment-seats to get gain, Hel. 7:4–5. Nephites have forgotten God to get gain, Hel. 7:21. wo unto him who shall say to get gain that there can be no miracle, 3 Ne. 29:7. no one shall have plates to get gain, Morm. 8:14. secret combinations built up to get gain, Morm. 8:40 (Ether 8:16, 22–23; 11:15). Jaredites traffic one with another to get gain, Ether 10:22.",
